       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="autoShowMatricesOnOpenCheckBox">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Auto-show matrix displays on open</string>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>When checked, opening a document automatically creates a Grouping Assistant Display with the Error, Template, Residual and Drift Matrix docks tabified into one frame (press E to step through them), then triggers an Update Error Matrix to populate them.  Saves the user from manually doing this on every document open.  Combines with the global window-geometry restore (already saved on close) to give a consistent layout across sessions.</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
